<title>INDIA: Delhi shares retreat sharply at close, Reliance up.</title>
<headline>Delhi shares retreat sharply at close, Reliance up.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Delhi shares shed their sizeable early gains in a late afternoon selloff on Friday linked to the end of settlement, but Reliance Industries resisted downward pressure to finish strongly.</p>
<p>The Delhi Stock Exchange's Sensitive Index ended the day down 0.75 point to 860.36.</p>
</text>
